uh rahula then says only material form blessed one and the buddha says no no there's also feeling perception uh habits of mental format or volitional formations and consciousness so those are your five aggregates if you remember but he didn't mention that he only mentioned the body so although he's put his material form he's obviously talking to rule about the body so the body past future present

