00:24:10,614 --> 00:24:11,535
Sitting tall.

194
00:24:14,198 --> 00:24:17,240
Just a moment now just to relax the brow

195
00:24:20,832 --> 00:24:21,532
The jaw.

196
00:24:23,275 --> 00:24:24,957
Lips together, teeth apart.

197
00:24:30,123 --> 00:24:30,743
Shoulders.

198
00:24:40,076 --> 00:24:42,238
Hands on the lap, whatever is comfortable.

199
00:24:42,258 --> 00:24:49,287
And acknowledging that posture.

200
00:24:59,002 --> 00:25:01,886
This body is subject to disease.

201
00:25:06,814 --> 00:25:09,498
This body is of a nature to fall ill.

202
00:25:15,165 --> 00:25:17,829
This body has not gone beyond sickness.

203
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:27,423
This body is subject to aging.

204
00:25:32,955 --> 00:25:35,357
This body has not gone beyond aging.

205
00:25:40,824 --> 00:25:43,707
This body is now in a process of aging.

206
00:25:50,173 --> 00:25:52,275
This body is subject to death.

207
00:25:58,541 --> 00:26:00,903
This body has not gone beyond death.

208
00:26:06,757 --> 00:26:08,859
This body will die.

209
00:26:15,328 --> 00:26:23,200
There is the unborn, undying, uncreated, uncompounded.

210
00:26:29,188 --> 00:26:30,569
The unconditioned.

211
00:26:34,346 --> 00:26:37,092
True refuge, harbour and home.

212
00:26:41,460 --> 00:26:44,224
Perfect peace and contentment.

213
00:26:49,734 --> 00:26:54,042
Those who are mindful are in the presence of Nirvana.

214
01:05:35,804 --> 01:05:37,226
A moment reflection.

215
01:05:37,266 --> 01:06:01,373
Resolution

216
01:06:13,856 --> 01:06:18,641
So make sure you feel comfortable to practice our contemplations.

217
01:06:26,108 --> 01:06:28,731
Speaking gently into our own hearts.

218
01:06:31,673 --> 01:06:34,797
May I be free of physical pain.

219
01:06:39,282 --> 01:06:42,565
May I be free of mental distress.

220
01:06:48,788 --> 01:06:52,268
May I experience the bliss of liberation.

221
01:07:27,213 --> 01:07:30,815
Bringing to mind someone we know who's having a hard time.

222
01:07:40,565 --> 01:07:43,068
May you be free of physical pain.

223
01:07:50,235 --> 01:07:53,018
May you be free of mental distress.

224
01:07:58,177 --> 01:08:11,461
May you be liberated of all your sufferings.

225
01:08:33,649 --> 01:08:38,577
And there are all those at this moment who are sick and or suffering from mental illness.

226
01:08:40,220 --> 01:08:46,509
People in the process of dying and those who have died and left grieving family, relatives and friends.

227
01:08:48,471 --> 01:08:51,497
People going hungry, homeless and destitute.

228
01:08:53,899 --> 01:08:58,948
Those having to deal with severe personal and interpersonal difficulties.

229
01:09:01,222 --> 01:09:04,427
All those caught up in wars and repressive regimes.

230
01:09:05,689 --> 01:09:06,872
Those being tortured.

231
01:09:09,136 --> 01:09:13,462
And there are those suffering from natural disasters and climate crisis.

232
01:09:16,488 --> 01:09:22,717
All the sentient beings are being cruelly treated and unnecessarily slaughtered.

233
01:09:25,141 --> 01:09:28,006
And all who find life meaningless.

234
01:09:29,675 --> 01:09:32,201
May you be free of physical pain.

235
01:09:36,252 --> 01:09:39,059
May you be free of mental distress.

236
01:09:43,890 --> 01:09:46,738
May you be liberated of all your sufferings.

237
01:10:16,317 --> 01:10:20,381
Radiating our compassion to all beings in all directions.

238
01:10:21,802 --> 01:10:24,947
May all beings be free of physical pain.

239
01:10:30,073 --> 01:10:32,836
May all beings be free of mental distress.

240
01:10:38,823 --> 01:10:42,747
May all beings be liberated of all their sufferings.

241
01:11:20,746 --> 01:11:34,125
Bringing to mind now moments of joyfulness we've experienced today, happiness, peacefulness.

242
01:11:34,145 --> 01:11:35,407
May I be joyful.

243
01:11:38,471 --> 01:11:40,253
May my joyfulness increase.

244
01:11:45,582 --> 01:11:49,587
May I experience the bliss of liberation.

245
01:12:13,918 --> 01:12:17,163
Bring to mind someone we know has caused to be joyful.

246
01:12:23,954 --> 01:12:25,197
May you be joyful.

247
01:12:29,663 --> 01:12:32,046
May your joyfulness increase.

248
01:12:38,858 --> 01:12:41,462
May you experience the bliss of awakening.

249
01:13:08,289 --> 01:13:31,125
And for all those at this moment who are content and happy with their lives, enjoying the warmth of friendships, delighting in art and nature, hobbies and so on, have meaningfulness in their work, enjoy the fruitfulness of their spiritual practice and rejoice in the success of others.

250
01:13:33,850 --> 01:13:35,412
May you be joyful.

251
01:13:39,846 --> 01:13:41,813
May your joyfulness increase.

252
01:13:45,965 --> 01:13:49,113
May you experience the bliss of Nirvana.

253
01:14:11,572 --> 01:14:15,680
Radiating our joy to all beings in all directions.

254
01:14:16,081 --> 01:14:18,444
May all beings be joyful.

255
01:14:22,512 --> 01:14:24,436
May your joyfulness increase.

256
01:14:29,345 --> 01:14:32,431
May you experience the bliss of Nirvana.

257
01:14:56,881 --> 01:15:00,666
Allow these words of the discourse on goodwill to flow through us.

258
01:15:01,426 --> 01:15:13,783
If you are wise and want to reach the state of peace, you need to be upright, responsible, gentle and humble, easily contented, need only a few things.

259
01:15:15,105 --> 01:15:20,012
Not always be busy and have the right sort of work.

260
01:15:20,033 --> 01:15:23,056
You need to guard the senses and be modest.

261
01:15:24,369 --> 01:15:28,114
You do not have to be exclusively attached to only a few people.

262
01:15:29,858 --> 01:15:33,724
You shouldn't do the slightest thing that a wise person could blame you for.

263
01:15:35,506 --> 01:15:36,927
Be thinking always.

264
01:15:37,148 --> 01:15:38,730
May all beings be happy.

265
01:15:39,492 --> 01:15:51,708
Whatever living beings there are, be they weak or strong, big or small, large or slender, living nearby or far away, those who've already been born and those who've yet to be born.

266
01:15:51,869 --> 01:15:52,791
May all beings

267
01:15:53,074 --> 01:16:15,876
without exception be happy be truthful to one another and do not think anyone anywhere is of no value do not wish harm to anyone even when you're angry just as a mother would protect her only child at the risk of her own life let the thought let the warmth of your heart go out to all beings

268
01:16:16,597 --> 01:16:46,064
let your thoughts of love go through the whole world above and below without any barrier with no ill will or hatred whether you are standing walking sitting or lying down so long as you're awake develop this affectionate mindfulness this they say is the noblest way to live and if you do not fall into unskillful ways but live well and develop insight and are no longer attached to all the desires of the senses

269
01:16:46,568 --> 01:16:50,957
then truly you'll never need to be reborn into this world again.

270
01:16:52,261 --> 01:16:58,335
Please join me in the chant, or if you will, using these traditional blessings.

271
01:16:59,117 --> 01:17:01,422
May you be safe, well and happy.

272
01:17:01,923 --> 01:17:05,471
May you live contented in harmony with the world.

273
01:17:07,578 --> 01:17:35,509
kāraṇīyaṁ gātaku salena yāndaṁ santāṁ padāṁ gābhīsāme ca sākaujū ca suhujū ca suvācchocā samuduva nāti māni sāntu sākaujā subhāro ca apākīcocā salāhu kāuti

274
01:17:36,198 --> 01:17:43,688
Santhendro chani bhago cha, apagabokule suvananukito.

275
01:17:45,489 --> 01:17:53,121
Na chakudansa machare kenchi, yena venyu pare upavadeyom.

276
01:17:54,021 --> 01:18:01,631
Sukhino vakemino hantu, sabesatabhavantu sukhitatam.

277
01:18:02,590 --> 01:18:32,395
yekechipana bhutati tasavatavarava anavasasam digavaye mahantavavajimarasakalukatulam ditavayeva aditaye cadurevasantiyavidure bhutavastambhavesivara

278
01:18:33,015 --> 01:18:37,742
Sābe sātā pāvāntu sukhi tātā.

279
01:18:37,761 --> 01:18:44,030
Nāpāro parā nīkū pētā, Nāti mānyatā kata cīnēn kēncī.

280
01:18:44,851 --> 01:18:51,300
Vīyāro sāna patīgā sānyā, Nānyamānyā sādukā gīcēnā.

281
01:18:52,421 --> 01:18:58,770
Mātāyatā nīyāṅ kūtāṅ, Gāyusāy kāpūtāṅ ānu nākē.

282
01:18:59,458 --> 01:19:07,328
Hey wampi sabba bhutensu, mana sambhava yeyaparimalam.

283
01:19:07,349 --> 01:19:13,997
Metencha sabbalokasmi, mana sambhava yeyaparimalam.

284
01:19:14,958 --> 01:19:22,108
Udanga docha tiriyanca, asampadanga veranga sapadam.

285
01:19:22,779 --> 01:19:31,515
Tīṭṭhāṁ ca rāṇiṣṭhino vāsāyāṇo vāyāvatāsavigāṭhānido.

286
01:19:31,536 --> 01:19:38,707
Hei tāṁ satiṅgāditeyā brahmāṅgētāṁ vihārāṅgītā mahū.

287
01:19:39,829 --> 01:19:46,442
Dītiṁ ca anupāgamaḥ sila vātāsānena-sampāna.

288
01:19:47,198 --> 01:19:56,904
kame suvene agedam nahi jatuka-bhaseyam punaretiti

289
01:19:59,247 --> 01:20:23,685
May all beings be happy.

290
01:20:25,537 --> 01:20:48,694
very good uh another very fruitful day without any doubt uh don't forget from now to fall asleep is also part of our practice putting something beautiful into the heart slip away into sweet oblivion awaking to take full con to take full advantage of the day may you sleep peacefully

